# people-mct

Core algorithms for multi-camera tracking (NumPy/SciPy).

Install editable from repo root:

```bash
pip install -e ./MCT
```

The `be` app imports this package. Optional: add `be/src` to `PYTHONPATH` when using `CameraPairCalibration` (fundamental matrix via `modules.pose_3d`).
